  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the raclette-grill to 200°C (400°F).",
    "Prepare the lamb shoulder by trimming any excess fat and seasoning it with Italian seasoning, garlic, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Drizzle the lamb with olive oil and place it on the grill.",
    "Cook for 20 minutes on each side or until the lamb reaches an internal temperature of 63°C (145°F).",
    "Meanwhile, place the red onion wedges on the grill for the last 5 minutes of cooking.",
    "Remove the lamb and let it rest for 5 minutes before slicing.",
    "Serve with the grilled red onion and a sprinkle of fresh rosemary.",
    "Blanch fresh rosemary leaves in boiling water for 10 seconds to preserve their flavor and color."
